# OS junk
.DS_Store
._*

# MATLAB
*.asv
*.m~

# Word lock files
~$*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data and results are not distributed through git.
#
# data/    ~3.8 GB of rendered stimuli, environmental illumination maps and raw
#          human responses. Archived separately (see README) because it far
#          exceeds what a GitHub repository should hold.
# results/ regenerated from data/ by main.m; results/model/ alone is ~13,500
#          files, and nothing in here is a source of truth.
# figs/    regenerated from results/ by the plot_* scripts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
results/
figs/

# Working copy of the raw data taken before the nocontext/context rename
data_backup_before_rename/
rename_bg_to_context.log.json

# The manuscript and everything used to build it stay local until publication:
# the drafts themselves, the figures embedded in them, the pandoc build scripts,
# and doc/refs/ (unpublished manuscripts by other people, kept only as writing-
# style references - these must never be published with this repo).
doc/

# Internal working record of the 2026 repository reorganisation, written for
# us rather than for readers of the published code.
PLAN.md

# Superseded material kept locally for reference only: the retired
# LaTeX/Overleaf version of the paper with its figures, and the pre-
# reorganisation scripts. None of it is needed to reproduce the analysis, and
# publishing it would only invite confusion with the current code.
legacy/
